Q: First Last button in MUI X Data grid A: <p>For MUI X Data Grid v8, the <code>slotProps</code> changed a bit and we now need to use something like:</p>
<pre class="lang-xml prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;DataGrid
   slotProps={{
      basePagination: {
          showFirstButton: true,
          showLastButton: true,
      }
   }}
/&gt;
</code></pre>

Q: In Windows 10, is there any way to determine whether a file extension has a *real* association? A: <p>Thanks to a commenter (thank you!) I discovered that you can pass the <code>ASSOCF_INIT_IGNOREUNKNOWN</code> flag to stop Windows giving you the OpenWith exe for unknown file types.  This now does what I want:</p>
<pre><code>private const uint S_OK = 0x0;
private const uint S_FALSE = 0x1;
private const uint ASSOCF_INIT_IGNOREUNKNOWN = 0x400;

// ...

private static string? getAssocString(string assoc, uint type) {
    uint length = 0;
    uint flags = 0;

    flags |= ASSOCF_INIT_IGNOREUNKNOWN;

    uint result = AssocQueryString(
        flags,
        type,
        assoc,
        null,
        null!,
        ref length
    );

    if (result != S_FALSE &amp;&amp; result != S_OK) {
        return null;
    }

    var sb = new StringBuilder((int)length);

    result = AssocQueryString(
        flags,
        type,
        assoc,
        null,
        sb,
        ref length
    );

    return result == 0 ? $&quot;{sb}&quot; : null;
}
</code></pre>
